# Canonical identity for agent/AI commits in this fork.
#
# This file only changes what git *displays* (shortlog, log --use-mailmap,
# blame): commit hashes and the objects themselves are untouched, so nothing
# has to be force-pushed and forks stay valid.
#
# The upstream authors (misa198, Thanh Vu) are deliberately NOT remapped: their
# commits are their own work and the GPL credit for them stays intact.

